{{Headline|22|Old School RuneScape: Twisted League}}

[[File:Old School RuneScape Twisted League (1).png|center|600px]]

Gather around and prepare yourself for a brand new game mode. After recently announcing [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/introducing-old-school-runescape-leagues?oldschool=1 Old School RuneScape Leagues], we want to now present to you the very first iteration of that mode: '''Twisted League'''.

In the Twisted League, you'll play an ironman (or ironwoman), locked to the Kourend and Kebos regions. Set out on an all new kind of challenge, thinking outside of the box while you attempt to unlock as many points as possible for relics and rewards. Set yourself apart from the rest, or just try out an exciting new way to play the game you love.

Old School RuneScape Twisted League will last for two months from the initial release date. Everyone participating in the league will start off as a fresh account on a separate game world. To customise your gameplay, you will be given the option to pick a relic from the very start. The more tasks you complete, the more points you get, and the more relics you can unlock.

'''Changelog:'''

* The first set of Relic choices have had their buffs updated slightly
* A new quest has been unlocked
* Barbarian Hasta/Fishing training has been auto-completed
* The XP multiplier on a league world will now be 5 instead of 3
* Two Kourend and Kebos diary tasks have been auto-completed
* The Barbarian Rod, Anti-Dragon Shield, and Pestal & Mortar will now appear in shops around Kourend and Kebos
* Selected shop stocks will restock at an accelerated rate
* Item drops of specific items have been changed


Below is a sneak peek of the the Twisted League specifics. We recommend you expand each section fully.

